{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45110","headline":"春日陪颜使君真卿皇甫曾西亭重会韵海诸生 · 皎然","name":"春日陪颜使君真卿皇甫曾西亭重会韵海诸生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲重南台客，朝朝会鲁儒。\n暄风衆木变，清景片云无。\n峰翠飘檐下，溪光照座隅。\n不将簪艾隔，知与道情俱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}